        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Qiao, an 18-year-old boy, loses his voice while delivering a eulogy for his late father. He runs away from the funeral and hides from his family. Between past, present and future, the young man recalls his relationship with his brutal and secretive father, who left him a passion for boxing. Ten years later, now an engineer, Qiao develops an AI boxer to help people learn boxing. Training with the AI day by day, Qiao begins to see a ghost.​​",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "My Father's Son"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Qiao, 18 ans, vient de terminer ses examens d'entrée à l'université lorsqu'il apprend la mort de son père, brutal et secret, qui lui a légué une passion pour la boxe. Des années plus tard, devenu ingénieur, Qiao développe un logiciel d'entraînement de boxe utilisant l’intelligence artificielle. Il modélise un adversaire virtuel reprenant les traits de son père, qui bientôt lui échappe…",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "My Father's Son"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "　　邹桥从小与父亲相依为命，跟父亲练习拳击。父亲在他年少时离世，给他留下巨大痛苦。成年后，邹桥根据父亲的特点创造了一个VR拳手，希望在虚拟世界里与父亲再次相见。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Syn zmaga się ze spuścizną ojca, wykorzystując wspomnienia i model boksu oparty na sztucznej inteligencji. Opowieść, która łączy w sobie elementy science fiction, relacji rodzinnych i sportu.",
          "runtime": 100,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "My Father's Son"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "18歲時鄒橋的父親離世了，他在喪禮悼詞中臨陣逃脫，甚至無法面對儀式性的道別，只想關閉通訊、躲進夜店喧鬧的音樂中，假裝徜徉漂浮於水上，掩埋悲傷；十年後，他已成家立業，並透過人工智慧在虛擬實境中重建「父親」，嘗試彌補未曾說出口的遺憾，就像是父親曾經教他關於拳擊的事情，他也試圖與這名AI父親，溝通、對話並學習一切的可能。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "比如父子"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
